	(text "Status from always-powered parts (A, B, C):\n1k in series (hot socket, DS-02012 3.6).\nPOE_LOSS_N: block B open drain, 4k7 pull-up\non the net (pre-config sweep, E-pinmap.md).\nACF_PULSE: 4k7 series (B's 74LVC2G08)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.6 163.83 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "9cb3a050-e031-4488-b98f-ae687e7beeb5")
	)
	(text "RMII to the LAN8720A (ethernet sheet): REFCLK on\nPCLKT1_0 (C8). MODE straps (RXD0/1, CRS_DV),\nMDIO, nRST and nINT pulls sit at the PHY.\nLPF: PULLMODE=UP on A11, A12, B11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.07 150.11 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "d59f3824-f923-425d-9e80-8abf26da3968")
	)
	(text "Display, LED and Qwiic power (block G/C).\nAlways-driven inputs: 1k series,\npair partners K15, D14, F14 left open.\nB15 (S0_IN) unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.49 152.65 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "1aadbbfc-17ac-4ae5-8b6f-1dd770942919")
	)
	(text "Audio (block F) and PIO link control (RP2350).\nMADC_DOUT, PDM_DAT: 330R; HP_FAULT_N, HP_DET: 1k;\npartners L15, P14, P12, K12 left open.\nLINK_CLK on PCLKT3_0 (M16)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 333.48 155.19 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "d0f9179e-91da-4599-88c8-508eb5aeb4e6")
	)
	(text "CLK_AUX (K1, PCLKT7_0): spare clock input\non a test pad (external low-jitter clock option).\nDC_W_n / DC_T_n: 1k series, partners J2 / H2 open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.67 278.64 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "039c5840-0240-47e2-b064-8c4387db2780")
	)
	(text "Power stage (block D). PWM_* from ODDRX2F at 589.824 Mb/s\n(PLL x12 from VCXO_CLK on P6, LLC_GPLL0T_IN; P5 open).\nFAULT_*: always driven, 330R, partners L2 / M2 open.\nT3 open: it pairs with PWM_T_B (R4).\nADC chip selects: 4k7 pull-ups keep the ADCs\ndeselected through configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.17 314.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "4ea536e3-fa66-420b-86b0-014ecebb3438")
	)
	(text "sysCONFIG slave SPI from the RP2350 (SPI1, 37.5 MHz):\nCFGMDN[2:0] = 001: CFG0 4k7 up, CFG1/CFG2 to GND.\nCCLK 1k pull-up to VCCIO8 (TN-02038 Tab 6.2);\n33R series at the RP2350 (mcu sheet).\nPROGRAMN, INITN, DONE, SN, HOLDN: 4k7 up.\nJTAG: TDI, TMS, TDO 4k7 up, TCK 4k7 down\n(TN-02038 Tab 6.1); header on the io sheet.\nLINK_D0-7 / LINK_IRQ: PIO link (E-link.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.59 352.3 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "4d14706e-035c-43d5-ae52-1db03ef894f7")
	)
